    "plan": "Outline a hypothetical RAG sanity check procedure. Specify the use of 30 local documents. Detail the comparison between retrieval-on and retrieval-off modes. Mention the handling of unanswerable questions. Explicitly state the hypothetical nature and lack of actual results."
